{
  "dom_id": "questionContainer",
  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Compute the result of the following operations on elements of ${Z}_{8}.$ Use the smallest nonnegative representative for the resulting class.\n\n$[\\,10\\,]\\cdot ([\\,3\\,]-[\\,6\\,])=[$\n{{field-1}}\n$]$",
  "worked_solution": "Addition, subtraction, and multiplication of integers in ${Z}_{n}$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\,a\\,]\\pm [\\,b\\,] & =[\\,a\\pm b\\,] \\\\ [\\,a\\,]\\cdot [\\,b\\,] & =[\\,a\\cdot b\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, recall that we can pick any element of an equivalence class as its representative. \n\nIn this case, all operations are carried out modulo $8.$\n\nWith that in mind, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\,10\\,]\\cdot ([\\,3\\,]-[\\,6\\,]) & =[\\,10\\,]\\cdot [\\,3-6\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,10\\,]\\cdot [\\,-3\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,10\\,]\\cdot [\\,0-3\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,10\\,]\\cdot [\\,8-3\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,10\\,]\\cdot [\\,5\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,8+2\\,]\\cdot [\\,5\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,0+2\\,]\\cdot [\\,5\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,2\\,]\\cdot [\\,5\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,2\\cdot 5\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,10\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,8+2\\,] \\\\  & =[\\,2\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
